!Name: highway-robber
!CThis device eats gliders without affecting gliders on any
!Cmore distant path. It can potentially emit a signal glider
!Cwhen it eats a glider.
!CThe full recovery time for the far edge of the circuit is 2234
!Cticks, though the robber is ready to steal another glider
!Cafter 1696 ticks.
!CDave Greene, 11 January 2007
!Source: jslife-oversize-20100113
!
